# Keep the build context small: only the engine source, ops/ (for the tile & stair-table JSON
# files that serve.env references via ${REPO}/ops/...), and tools/ (for the corpus build and
# drop_page_cache.py) are needed. Nothing else is read at runtime.
.git
.github
*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
!VERSION
docs/
tests/
media/
.tandemllm-*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.log
corpus/
state/
logs/
